cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this release, please cite the paper and this repository."
title: "Incident Alignment: reproducible DeepWide-based incident clustering and cross-lingual event-level evaluation"
abstract: >-
  Reproduction package for training a Deep+Wide pairwise incident matcher on five
  incident-level folds, selecting clustering thresholds on Dev only, and evaluating
  held-out English and Chinese (Gold v2.0.2, 1,283 reports / 185 events) event-level
  clustering with fixed thresholds (Hungarian event-level F1, B-cubed, ARI/NMI, and
  induced pairwise P/R/F1).
type: software
